                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "We visited the restaurant twice this month, and we all had wonderful time. I know it is inevitable that we should order the food online, which made me pretty mad. I still had to know the details about the cuisine, and the pictures in the menu did not help at all. However, the waiters were quick to help. Maybe they need to set two tracks. I am not illiterate, but I really hate to order food in such a cold way. If I have to dine alone, I will definitely cross this out, and prefer to go to a cozy little cafe instead of such “fancy” restaurant.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
