                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Food and atmosphere were top notch. Rare finds for a western vegetarian restaurant. It is located in A11 level 2, entry within the mall. Spent a total of NTD 1500 for a burger, pizza and pasta which was rather worth it. Food were well done, could taste that it is handmade and ingredients were fresh. Highly recommend to try their burger! Non-allium options available.\n\nService could be improved, just not as welcoming and friendly as it were.",
